Z||000000||Philphine||04-24-2001||12:32 PM||||<BR>i was supposed to be putting in a fuel pressure guage to help me diagnose a stalling problem and hopefully for a future engine change. i held off to get an oil pressure guage so i could run the wires at the same time. i'll need it for when i put a gt intrument cluster i got in.<P>i need to know if i can just replace the factory sending unit or if it has to stay for whatever signal it might be sending else where. i would then be using a t fitting i guess to have them both in the system. <P>or if by chance someone happens to know if what ever signal the factory unit sends out would be compatible with an autometer 0-100 psi oil pressure gauge (pt no 3327). thanks for any help. ||||reg||1
